        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Notation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;PK&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; primary key&#160;&#160;|&#160;&#160;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;FK&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; foreign key&lt;br&gt;Crow&#8217;s foot: one-to-many.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;&#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Identity&#160;&#160;&lt;font color=&quot;#82b366&quot;&gt;&#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Content&#160;&#160;&lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;&#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Payment&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;&#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Taking&#160;&#160;&lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;&#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Practice&#160;&#160;&lt;font color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;&#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Reference&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;Dashed orange edge = composite FK.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;It enforces more than a plain FK: the selected option must&lt;br&gt;belong to that same question, and a group to the same exam.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;NOT shown here&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; (see the .sql file):&lt;br&gt;37 CHECK constraints, 25 unique indexes (18 filtered),&lt;br&gt;2 triggers, 1 procedure (usp_ExpireStalePendingOrders),&lt;br&gt;and all DEFAULT constraints. An ERD shows structure,&lt;br&gt;not enforcement." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1480" y="420" width="360" height="290" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
